<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $397 mln Oct 1 paper.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $397 mln Oct 1 paper.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Monday it placed $397.3 million in bank liquidity paper and 10.8 million pesos due Oct 1 at 99.6029.</p>
<p>It also placed November 1 paper worth $52.3 million and 14.5 million pesos at 99.1801.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
